      "milestone_description": "To bound the error in the number of bins produced by the algorithm, we use the following inequalities:\n$$LIN(I_{i+1}) \\le LIN(J_i) + 1 - X_i \\le LIN(I_i) + 1 - X_i$$\n$$\\therefore\\ \\sum_{i=1}^{t} X_i \\le LIN(J) + t$$\n",
